  "2026-07-10T11:10:41.183Z",codex,"PR #18 independent verification: npm ci/build passed; final suite 60/60 pass. Functional dry-runs covered --filter, --channel-override, --format custom/--template, notify/digest --thread, malformed inputs (exit 2, no stacks), real digest aggregation (created=2 closed=1 in_progress=1), and localhost-only HTTP sink payload capture (no Slack webhook). Found/fixed HTTP sink transport mismatch, default JSON regression, ad-hoc filter context, digest custom-format misreporting, and env custom-template hook fallback. Default slack test/notify output now byte-identical to origin/main."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-06-07T07:41:50.193Z",codex-5.3-full-cycle,"Hardening pass complete: release:check succeeded after dependency bump and changelog regeneration."
  "2026-06-07T08:00:43.949Z",codex-5.3-full-cycle,"Security gate: high-confidence token/key regex scan over tracked files and git history found no actionable secrets. Binary-history false positives were traced to embedded wasm base64 blobs, not credentials."
